WEBVTT

00:11:59.579 --> 00:12:04.371
I understand I said to them, but
you have dead people's goals.

00:12:17.246 --> 00:12:22.912
Only dead people never get unwanted or
inconvenienced by their feelings,

00:12:24.287 --> 00:12:29.079
only dead people never get stressed,
never get broken hearts,

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:33.537
never experience the disappointment
that comes with failure.